{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061016/block/singleImage/3252580/wm/01M63M5NFMC1A7H9Z07ZYFG62K.jpg?updatedAt=1793270768\"/><figcaption>曾煥平指，一旦加息，將難免增加買家的供樓負擔，以及加重發展商的財務壓力。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>仲量聯行香港主席曾煥平表示，是次美國不加息，不代表加息陰霾已消除。現時美國通脹壓力仍然高企，加息壓力日重，加上港元與美元掛鉤，現時香港與美國的息差已擴大，美國進一步加息及香港跟隨上調利率，相信都只是時間問題。 曾煥平指，一旦加息，將難免增加買家的供樓負擔，以及加重發展商的財務壓力，因此，近期不少發展商的新盤開價已趨向保守，求量多於求價。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061016/block/singleImage/3252584/wm/01M63M75J0FD3P7R1Q3XT64XV4.jpg?updatedAt=1793270768\"/><figcaption>仲量聯行香港主席曾煥平。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:40.303568+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:19.222435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:22.069731+00:00","content_hash":"56db1b041e2027eec79b79644e2ab376fdba6c21505d7a32f35e0a4dcc64a7c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:40.303568+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}